OL,3,GNEWSA'Don't worry This City Is Ours
OL,4,Afans - Banksey's cat is just fine'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This story reveals
OL,7,Fdetails of This City Is Ours Series 2
OL,9,FFear not, This City Is Ours fans,
OL,10,FBanksey's cat is absolutely fine...
OL,12,FGeorge "Banksey" Banks, portrayed by
OL,13,FMike Noble, is the loyal right-hand man
OL,14,Fand enforcer for Michael Kavanagh,
OL,15,Fplayed by James Nelson-Joyce in the hit
OL,16,FBBC One show.
OL,18,FDespite his violent life of crime,
OL,19,FBanksey has a much softer side, for as
OL,20,Fwell as being a devoted father he is
OL,21,Fproud cat dad.
